flowchart LR
    accTitle: From a building request to a verified construction
    accDescr: The coordinator asks the Architect for a drawing. Code validates it and computes materials; invalid drawings return feedback. A saved blueprint reference and material bill inform the planner. The action agent gathers resources and invokes an algorithmic Builder, which verifies the placed blocks and reports its result.
    subgraph DESIGN["1 · Design"]
        direction TB
        AR["Coordinator → Architect<br/>Draw horizontal layers"] --> V{"Valid drawing?"}
        V -->|"No: feedback"| AR
        V -->|"Yes"| BP["Saved Blueprint<br/>Geometry + material bill"]
    end
    subgraph PREPARE["2 · Prepare"]
        direction TB
        CP["Coordinator → Planner<br/>Plan resources and construction"] --> A["Action agent<br/>Acquire required materials"]
    end
    subgraph EXECUTE["3 · Build"]
        direction TB
        B["build(blueprintId, origin)<br/>Algorithmic Builder<br/>Move · equip · place · verify"] --> R["Report to coordinator<br/>Complete or partial / failed"]
    end
    DESIGN -->|"Blueprint reference"| PREPARE
    PREPARE -->|"Invoke build"| EXECUTE
